{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "74a3a3358c1222e4cbd5e40235eae493bb55b33c2cbf90324fc19f72116df5fc", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が終わった。\n今日の志保は、なんだか雰囲気が柔らかかったな）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄结束了。\n今天的志保，感觉气氛柔和了不少。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "9bfd5e53617836735b0405c5c15acf6923f18063638ca2ed6d93b83faca244dc", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n……どうしたんですか？　ボーッとして。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n……您怎么了？一直在发呆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "de554de891e1979c44a08143830d3061a44fc4f1d88e4a7d956a29f516b62009", "ja": "お疲れさま。いい撮影だったから、\n仕上がりが楽しみだと思ってね。", "zh": "辛苦了。这次拍摄很顺利，\n所以我很期待成片的效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "b03a52c5b4f093c8bdb2d07c9ce1c99d26947921157f42d0503a66503242cb34", "ja": "そうですか。期待に応えられる出来になったかは\nわかりませんけど……よかったです。", "zh": "是这样啊。虽然不知道拍出来的效果能不能达到您的期待……不过，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "c3d906077e3ee4250770bb85ea1bf37e192a8b91b7ef16850feccdcd01dd06e3", "ja": "ただ、私が想像していたパジャマと少し違ったので、\n驚きました……。", "zh": "不过，和我想象中的睡衣有一点不一样，所以有些惊讶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1005_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "e6c9a7d62cfa1641bb7d2445e2d86dfd9d6aa897b8556cda739f722bb2b3f345", "ja": "こんな大人っぽいパジャマ……。\n今更ですけど、発注ミスじゃないですよね？", "zh": "这么成熟风的睡衣……。\n现在才问，不过这不是下单弄错了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c7098c33aa183348fd68addd95d35e2eb7b5c97f207bc90d3599d85f345d7934", "ja": "違う違う！\nちゃんと志保のだよ。間違いない！", "zh": "不是不是！这确实是志保的，绝对没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "a5564b8cc117b46750573257244f53d03973bd8c127b43f8467b57eb8098c210", "ja": "そんなに慌てなくても……冗談です。セクシーすぎて、\nきちんと着こなせるか心配だったんです。", "zh": "不用这么慌张……开玩笑的。只是因为太性感了，我有点担心自己能不能驾驭好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1009_p", "source_sha256": "39b81751050182de576dec81159f683f80bbc268a2e03cfb3494ba53b60785d6", "ja": "そうなのか？\nすごいリラックスしてたように見えたけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n不过我看你刚才好像特别放松……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "1ee26d251fce81bf4b92cb09c881760aefa85ce829164e00868b777fb7b27648", "ja": "それはあの子……\nクマのぬいぐるみが一緒だったからだと思います。", "zh": "那是因为那个孩子……我想，是因为有熊玩偶陪着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "7e0855c25f69bada8b736b6de6a37dd96726b22871ca60fec838715f8ccedf57", "ja": "家でもそばに置いてて、なんだか安心できるんです。\nこの子がいたから、そう見えたのかも。", "zh": "在家里我也把它放在身边，总觉得能让人安心。\n或许是因为有它在，才显得那样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9a58851caa3f816a53b231040efd701afaec746dbb4d53554f13969eb883e438", "ja": "なるほどな。撮影中、志保の表情が穏やかだったのは、\nその子のおかげだったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。拍摄时志保的表情那么平静，是因为这个孩子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "f8eb0554a79e27dc6fa2b6eacaf88dc4dfb7308f0605d9d117531ca516409f9b", "ja": "穏やか……。そうですね。\nこの子がいてくれたからかもしれません。", "zh": "平静……。是啊，也许是因为有这个孩子陪着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f5c168ef990a91680c6f68fe020cf039c1ce5e81f627d131908d4872e1211cbd", "ja": "ああ。ぬいぐるみに挨拶する時とか、\n志保らしさが特に出てたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯。比如向玩偶打招呼的时候，特别能体现出志保的风格吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "6526085c7c2696cb128deae81317142db0ed0275788aaf5ebe6fdee687f2d02d", "ja": "あれは、家でやってるようにって指示だったので。\nでも中学生であんなこと……子供っぽいですよね？", "zh": "那只是因为指示要求像在家里那样做而已。\n不过都上初中了还做那种事……很孩子气吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cb7dd0f4870019d9e198178e0482ed73041e8025fd995f530adaf11e1d4a5a26", "ja": "そんなことないよ。\n志保が大事にしてるんだなって、伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "没那回事。看得出来，志保很珍惜它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1017_p", "source_sha256": "281dfbdf7ee1554f6ecbaf9e1bd0c186da5c1fcba4fa21868321a0be000b7445", "ja": "あとで、ちゃんと褒めてあげてほしい。\n今日は志保と一緒に頑張ってくれたんだからな。", "zh": "待会儿，请好好夸夸她。\n毕竟她今天一直和志保一起努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_033sih0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_033sih0303_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "494d2edbc5269929458a1b66ef285fd3b64de7635cf797918cf8c2f40737f4ed", "ja": "はい。そうします。\n家に帰ったら、いっぱい。ふふっ。", "zh": "好的，就这么办。\n回到家后，要尽情地……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
